hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1041","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Farz hisson ko un ke walon se milao. Phir jo bache wo sab se qareebi mard ke liye hai."
"1042","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main beemar hua. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri ayadat ke liye tashreef laye aur Abu Bakr, jabke wo dono paidal they. Phir unhon ne mujhe behosh paya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wuzu farmaya, phir apna wuzu ka pani mujh par dala. Phir main hosh mein aaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) they. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main apne maal mein kaise karun? Apne maal mein kaise faisla karun? Phir Aap ne mujhe koi jawab na diya yahan tak ke miras ki ayat nazil hui."
"1043","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aakhri surat nazil hui Bara'at, aur aakhri ayat nazil hui [wo tum se fatwa mangte hain]."
"1044","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas faut-shuda shakhs laya jata jis par qarz hota. Phir Aap poochhte: Kya us ne apne qarz ke liye fazilat chhori hai? Phir agar Aap ko khabar di jati ke us ne apne qarz ke liye wafa chhori hai to namaz parhte. Warna Musalmanon se farmate: Apne sathi par namaz parho. Phir jab Allah ne Aap par futooh fatah farmayein to Aap ne farmaya: Main mominon se un ki jaanon se zyada qareeb hun. Phir mominon mein se jo faut ho aur qarz chhore to mujh par us ka ada karna hai. Aur jo maal chhore to us ke warison ke liye hai."
